{"id":"2ba6c7f35c1a7f30","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-graph-power.md","title":"正则旋转图的路径幂","display":"df-graph-power — 正则旋转图的路径幂","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-graph-power","aliases":["28-df-graph-power"],"display":"df-graph-power — 正则旋转图的路径幂","depends_on":["[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]","[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]"],"source_book_location":"§21.3.2","source_printed_pages":"434–435","source_pdf_pages":"460–461","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-graph-power"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-graph-power</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-graph-power — 正则旋转图的路径幂"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b6b8966305e02a9\" href=\"?note=0b6b8966305e02a9\" title=\"28-df-regular-rotation-graph\">28-df-regular-rotation-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c9d3a0ba202211c\" href=\"?note=1c9d3a0ba202211c\" title=\"28-df-random-walk-matrix\">28-df-random-walk-matrix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"434–435"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"460–461"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b6b8966305e02a9\" href=\"?note=0b6b8966305e02a9\" title=\"28-df-regular-rotation-graph\">28-df-regular-rotation-graph</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in[N]\">\\(v\\in[N]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec i=(i_1,\\ldots,i_k)\\in[D]^k\">\\(\\vec i=(i_1,\\ldots,i_k)\\in[D]^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}\">\\(\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}\\)</span> 为下式定义的端口编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_t,j_t\">\\(v_t,j_t\\)</span> 依赖当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,\\vec i\">\\(v,\\vec i\\)</span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 有限递归。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_G\">\\(P_G\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c9d3a0ba202211c\" href=\"?note=1c9d3a0ba202211c\" title=\"28-df-random-walk-matrix\">28-df-random-walk-matrix</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}(i_1,\\ldots,i_k)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{t=1}^k(i_t-1)D^{k-t},\\qquad\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}:[D]^k\\xrightarrow{\\sim}[D^k].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}(i_1,\\ldots,i_k)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{t=1}^k(i_t-1)D^{k-t},\\qquad\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}:[D]^k\\xrightarrow{\\sim}[D^k].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_0\\coloneqq v,\\qquad(v_t,j_t)\\coloneqq R(v_{t-1},i_t)\\quad(1\\le t\\le k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_0\\coloneqq v,\\qquad(v_t,j_t)\\coloneqq R(v_{t-1},i_t)\\quad(1\\le t\\le k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^{[k]}(v,\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}(i_1,\\ldots,i_k))\\coloneqq(v_k,\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}(j_k,\\ldots,j_1)),\\qquad G^{[k]}\\coloneqq(N,D^k,R^{[k]}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^{[k]}(v,\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}(i_1,\\ldots,i_k))\\coloneqq(v_k,\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}(j_k,\\ldots,j_1)),\\qquad G^{[k]}\\coloneqq(N,D^k,R^{[k]}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^{[k]}:[N]\\times[D^k]\\to[N]\\times[D^k],\\qquad G^{[k]}\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D^k},\\qquad P_{G^{[k]}}=P_G^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^{[k]}:[N]\\times[D^k]\\to[N]\\times[D^k],\\qquad G^{[k]}\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D^k},\\qquad P_{G^{[k]}}=P_G^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>倒序记录返回端口，使沿路径逆走恰好恢复原端口字串，因此旋转映射仍是对合。均匀选择 D^k 个端口字串相当于 k 次独立均匀邻居步，得到矩阵幂。这里只定义同一图的幂；两个不同对称图的矩阵乘积通常不对称，不能无条件当成同一无向旋转图模型。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§21.3.2；印刷页 434–435；PDF 页 460–461。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-random-walk-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"1c9d3a0ba202211c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","sta