tensor-product]]、[[28-df-replacement-product]]、[[28-thm-tensor-product-expansion]]、[[28-thm-replacement-product-expansion]]、[[28-df-flat-source]]、[[28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition]]、[[28-df-branching-program]]、[[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]、[[28-thm-reingold]]、[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]、[[28-thm-nisan-space-prg]]。"}],"outgoing":["0b6b8966305e02a9","1c9d3a0ba202211c"]}